  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Policy and Financing options-UNDP-HTI-00122641</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">This project will help Haiti to assess financing options for National SDG Strategy achievement and to formulate and implement comprehensive action plans and, where required, policy reforms to mobilize such funding in a way that is best aligned to national SDG Strategy Goals.Identified scenarios for financing mobilization will in turn lead to the possible revision in the current SDG Strategy and Goals, in which financing options and challenges have as of now not been considered.While the project</narrative>
  </description>
